{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日録画してたスターマン見てたんだけど\nバナナマンさんと東京03さんのライブの\nHandmadeWorksが一瞬うつってたよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいて高まった(￣ー￣)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は収録だったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと買い物に行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあまあ行動力あるんだよね\nよく言われますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寄り道してたら\n帰りの電車で雷を見たよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車を降りた時には\nもう止んでたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば\n今日、昨日、一昨日と雷雨にあってる(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はライブだし\n天気よくなーれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多で何か食べたいものある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n鉄なべの餃子！\nミオミオのピリ辛ひき肉とさくさくポテトのサラダパスタ！\n今回は行けなさそうだけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男子の浴衣姿は好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいいよね！爽やかで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の福岡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼も夜も\n上手多めです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/22/8099963/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/22/8099963/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、ゆっきーなと会ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど\n誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"bre